        "startIndex": 5497,
        "endIndex": 5879,
        "text": "#### **[14] Mark Zuckerberg Interview: Connect products and AI regulation views**\n* **Confirmed:** In an interview with Joanna Stern at Connect 2026, Meta CEO Mark Zuckerberg discussed the newly unveiled camera-free Ray-Ban Meta Audio glasses ($349) and expressed opposition to mandatory industry-wide AI safety governance, arguing individual AI labs should manage safety internally"
