        "endIndex": 6447,
        "text": "#### **[15] YouTube: CEO Neal Mohan rejects Meta child safety settlement**\n* **Confirmed:** At YouTube's *Made on YouTube* event, CEO Neal Mohan publicly dismissed joining Meta's $18B multistate child safety settlement, stating YouTube already maintains sufficient safety features and works with third-party advisors"
